units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.52
region simulation_box block 0 10 0 10 0 10 units lattice
create_box 1 simulation_box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.001
velocity all create 600 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp press pe ke etotal vol density
fix ensemble all npt temp 300 2500 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1
run 220000
